      "description": "<blockquote>\n<h3>Version 2.15.359</h3>\n<p><strong>✨ Added</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Nearby Items panel can now be used as a staging area for loot management.</li>\n<li>Items can be organized, transferred, and dropped more naturally using the Vicinity Stash.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🐛 Fixed</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue that could cause duplicate item models to appear on the ground under certain circumstances. This was a visual issue only, but could make it difficult to tell which loot was actually present.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔮 Planned</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Perception skill integration.</li>\n<li>Remove configurable scan distances.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n",
